1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,500
Welcome to DevShield, an autonomous zero-egress code security auditor

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,600
built for the Build Hybrid AI 2026 hackathon.

3
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:14,200
DevShield uses Chrome Gemini Nano via Firebase AI Logic

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:18,500
to scan proprietary code on-device with zero data egress.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,660
It instantly detects hardcoded payment keys and SQL injection in milliseconds.

6
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:28,500
Applying hardened fixes eliminates every vulnerability,

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:33,160
boosting the security health score to one hundred with full OWASP compliance.

8
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:39,000
The interactive Monaco visual diff inspector lets developers compare

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,050
vulnerable code with automated AST-hardened security mitigations side by side.

10
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:49,300
DevShield generates executive OWASP Top 10 compliance reports

11
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:53,860
with one-click export to Markdown and JSON for audit certification.

12
00:00:55,130 --> 00:01:00,000
When sensitive credentials like AWS keys and JWT tokens are detected,

13
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:05,240
DevShield redacts them on-device before any external communication.

14
00:01:06,630 --> 00:01:11,000
Only sanitized payloads are escalated to Firebase Cloud Gemini

15
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,630
with App Check attestation, generating automated regression test suites.

16
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:23,200
DevShield combines the privacy of on-device Gemini Nano

17
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:28,100
with the power of Firebase Cloud. Fast, private, and secure.
